{"book":"bu-vb-as","suttas":[{"id":"pli-tv-bu-vb-as1-7","title":"Adhikaraṇasamatha","rows":[["pli-tv-bu-vb-as1:0.1","Theravāda Vinaya","","",""],["pli-tv-bu-vb-as1:0.2","Mahāvibhaṅga","","",""],["pli-tv-bu-vb-as1:0.3","Adhikaraṇasamatha","","8. Adhikaraṇasamathā",""],["pli-tv-bu-vb-as1:1.1","Ime kho panāyasmanto satta adhikaraṇasamathā dhammā uddesaṁ āgacchanti.","ime kho panāyasmanto satta adhikaraṇasamathā dhammā uddesaṃ āgacchanti.","Ime kho panāyasmanto satta adhikaraṇasamathā Dhammā uddesaṃ āgacchanti.","ime kho panāyasmanto satta adhikaraṇasamathā dhammā uddesaṃ āgacchanti."],["pli-tv-bu-vb-as1:2.1","Uppannuppannānaṁ adhikaraṇānaṁ samathāya vūpasamāya","uppannuppannānaṃ adhikaraṇānaṃ samathāya vūpasamāya","Uppannuppannānaṃ adhikaraṇānaṃ samathāya vūpasamāya","uppannuppannānaṃ adhikaraṇānaṃ samathāya vūpasamāya"],["pli-tv-bu-vb-as1:2.2","sammukhāvinayo dātabbo,","sammukhāvinayo dātabbo,","sammukhāvinayo dātabbo,","sammukhāvinayo dātabbo"],["pli-tv-bu-vb-as2:1.1","sativinayo dātabbo,","sativinayo dātabbo,","sativinayo dātabbo,","sativinayo dātabbo"],["pli-tv-bu-vb-as3:1.1","amūḷhavinayo dātabbo,","amūḷhavinayo dātabbo,","amūḷhavinayo dātabbo,","amūḷhavinayo dātabbo"],["pli-tv-bu-vb-as4:1.1","paṭiññāya kāretabbaṁ,","paṭiññāya kāretabbaṃ,","paṭiññāya kāretabbaṃ,","paṭiññāya kāretabbaṃ"],["pli-tv-bu-vb-as5:1.1","yebhuyyasikā,","yebhuyyasikā, tassapāpiyyasikā,","yebhuyyasikā,","yebhuyyasikā tassa pāpiyasikā"],["pli-tv-bu-vb-as6:1.1","tassapāpiyasikā,","","tassapāpiyasikā,",""],["pli-tv-bu-vb-as7:1.1","tiṇavatthārakoti.","tiṇavatthārakoti.","tiṇavatthārakoti.","tiṇavatthārakoti."],["pli-tv-bu-vb-as7:2.1","Uddiṭṭhā kho, āyasmanto, satta adhikaraṇasamathā dhammā.","uddiṭṭhā kho āyasmanto satta adhikaraṇasamathā dhammā.","Uddiṭṭhā kho, āyasmanto, satta adhikaraṇasamathā dhammā.","uddiṭṭhā kho āyasmanto satta adhikaraṇasamathā dhammā."],["pli-tv-bu-vb-as7:2.2","Tatthāyasmante pucchāmi—","tatthāyasmante pucchāmi","Tatthāyasmante pucchāmi –","tatthāyasmante pucchāmi"],["pl